WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.467
-Republicans are waging war
on Disney

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.133
and concocting some very bizarre

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.100
fictional scenarios
about its characters,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.834
While a new lawsuit seeks

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.534
to keep Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:11.767
off the ballot in November

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.234
for trying to help overthrow
the 2020 election.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:16.334
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:20.667
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.767
You guys, as we have said
many times on this show,

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:26.300
the modern Republican Party is,
among many other things,

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.934
a collection of some of the
weirdest people in the world.

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:31.567
There's just no other way
to say it.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:34.234
They constantly say
and do weird [bleep].

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.934
Like when North Carolina
Congressman Madison Cawthorn

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:39.434
[ Laughter ]
said he'd been invited
by members of Congress

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:42.934
to wild, drug-fueled orgies
he called sexual get-togethers.

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.567
[ Laughter ]
Meanwhile, a Fox News host

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.567
promoted what he called
testicle tanning,

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:49.234
which apparently involves
exposing your balls

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.934
to something called
red light therapy.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:52.601
And, guessing by his face,

00:00:52.601 --> 00:00:54.501
Rudy Giuliani was the first
person to try it.

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:56.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:57.667
[ As Giuliani ]
I only have money
for one right now.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:00.067
I'll be back next month
to finish the job.

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:00.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:02.000
And then, on top of all that,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.801
Texas Senator Ted Cruz whined

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:06.634
about Disney's opposition
to Florida's recent ban

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:09.868
on discussions of sexual
orientation or gender identity

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:11.167
in kindergarten
through third grade,

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:14.067
referred to by critics
as the Don't Say Gay bill,

00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:17.033
by painting this incredibly
disturbing image

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:18.767
that we now all have
to live with.

00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:21.567
-I think there are people
who are misguided,

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:25.267
trying to drive, you know,
Disney stepping in, saying,

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:28.601
you know, in every episode,
now, they're going to have,

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.400
you know, you know,

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.801
Mickey and Pluto going at it.

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.734
[ Laughter ]
Like really?

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.100
-Thank you for that image,

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.868
Senator.
-You know, but it's just like

00:01:37.868 --> 00:01:39.133
come on, guys.

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.033
Like these are kids.

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.701
And, you know,

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:45.934
you could always shift
to Cinemax, if you want that.

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:47.167
-You can?!

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:48.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:51.067
Which Cinemax package
do you have?

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:52.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.701
Just remember,
anytime you come up

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:56.400
with some kinky idea involving
two cartoon characters,

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.534
pornography has beat you to it.

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:00.200
[ Laughter ]
I bet if you Googled
Mickey and Pluto,

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.767
the top autocomplete options
would be...

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:06.133
[ Laughter ]
The point is

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.434
Ted Cruz jumping to that
conclusion makes it clear

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:09.734
he already has some pretty pervy
ideas about the Magic Kingdom.

00:02:09.734 --> 00:02:12.434
some pretty pervy ideas
about the Magic Kingdom.

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:14.133
[ Laughter ]
I'd hate to hear why he thinks

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.467
it's called Splash Mountain.

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:17.767
[ Laughter, ohs, and ewws ]

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.334
What does this man think
is going on

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:20.868
at the Country Bear Jamboree?

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:21.968
[ Sultry funk plays ]

00:02:21.968 --> 00:02:23.234
-♪ Unh ♪

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:26.167
[ Laughter and ohs ]
♪♪

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:28.000
♪♪

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.601
♪ Oh, baby ♪

00:02:29.601 --> 00:02:30.767
[ Laughter ]
-And, by the way,

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:32.467
you don't have to make stuff up.

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:34.501
There's already
some really shady behavior

00:02:34.501 --> 00:02:35.767
going on at Disney movies,

00:02:35.767 --> 00:02:38.534
like this lady who's running
some kind of weird,

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:40.234
off-the-books mining company

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:43.567
[ Laughter ]
