her employee's real names.

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.200
"Could you stop
calling me Grumpy?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.434
My name is Henry Sampson
and maybe I'm grumpy

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:49.067
because I pay attention
to the news!"

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:49.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.968 --> 00:02:51.767
And now,
Republicans are so angry

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:53.834
at Disney's opposition
to their bigoted law

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:55.367
that Florida
Governor Ron DeSantis

00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:57.801
is moving to retaliate
by revoking Disney's

00:02:57.801 --> 00:03:01.334
