which basically allows it

00:03:01.334 --> 00:03:03.734
to run its own governing
district in the state.

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:07.501
-Florida's Republican governor
putting the squeeze on Disney.

00:03:07.501 --> 00:03:10.467
Critics say he's retaliating
for the company's criticism

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:12.901
of the state's so-called
Don't Say Gay law,

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:14.067
limiting classroom instruction

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:17.033
on sexual orientation
and gender identity.

00:03:17.033 --> 00:03:19.100
Ron DeSantis
urging state lawmakers

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.133
who are meeting
in special session this week

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:24.567
to end Disney's self-governing
district in Orlando.

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:27.300
-It'll never cease to amaze me
that, on one hand,

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.567
you have liberal pundits,
like James Carville,

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:30.934
