from the mainstream,

00:03:33.534 --> 00:03:36.100
but meanwhile, Republicans
are waging war on Disney

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.067
and warning that,
if we don't act soon,

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:40.834
a mouse that can talk
will [bleep] a dog that can't.

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:43.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:45.200
Hey, he's the one
who brought it up!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.100
[ Laughter ]
And look, Disney doesn't
need me to defend them.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.367
They probably
don't even want me to,

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:51.000
after I made
that Splash Mountain joke.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.400
And I don't know,
maybe no corporation

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.400
