00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:02.334
And, purely
from a political perspective,

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:03.968
do you really think
it's a smart move

00:04:03.968 --> 00:04:06.767
to go after Disney, Republicans?
What's next?

00:04:06.767 --> 00:04:08.234
Are Eric and Don Jr. going to go

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:10.400
