00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.300
"We got your mom, and now,
we're back to finish the job!"

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.467
Sorry, I forgot
to say spoiler alert.

00:04:16.467 --> 00:04:18.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.033 --> 00:04:19.501
This is the kind of thing
Republicans

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:20.467
